         <div>
            <pb ed="TBOO" n="VII.91"/>
            <pb ed="A" n="106r"/>
            <opener>CLARISSIMO NOBILISSIMOQUE VIRO D. TYCHONI BRAHE, MATHEMATICO EXIMIO, DOMINO ET
                    AMICO PLURIMUM COLENDO.<lb/>S. D.</opener>
            <p rend="noIndent">MITTO tibi Chartam et Typos, quos <placeName ref="Wittenberg">Witeberga</placeName> accepi. Papyri singulas Risas æstimat
                    solidis 30. Hisce vasis inclusam ad me miserunt, si quid damni acceperit, non
                    est, quod me culpes. Reliquos Typos <persName ref="david_1585">DAVID</persName> auriga se allaturum, ubi fusi fuerint,
                    promisit. Poscit in pondo 100 Ioachimum unum. In universum pro pecunia transmissa
                    typorum fusori et typis huc transvehendis exigit 4 Thaleros. Quid insuper fieri
                    velis significabis</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>[<persName ref="brucaeus_heinrich_1530">HENRICUS BRUCÆUS</persName>.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
